## About the standard

Open framework for managing cybersecurity risks with the functions govern, identify, protect, detect, respond and recover.

The control and requirement statements below are reproduced in English from the publisher’s open data.

Official source: [NIST CSF 2.0](https://www.nist.gov/cyberframework).

